{"seq":1,"slug":"rich-notification-media","title":"富媒体通知与交互","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/implementation/rich-notification-media","wordCount":1192,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"富媒体通知与交互\">富媒体通知与交互</h1><p>标准推送通知只有标题加正文，视觉表达力有限。富媒体通知通过附加图片、视频、音频、自定义布局和交互按钮，将通知从&quot;一条文本提醒&quot;升级为&quot;一次微型交互体验&quot;。Airship 2026 年行业报告显示，携带富媒体内容的推送点击率比纯文本通知高出 56%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Notification Service Extension</strong>（iOS）：在通知展示前拦截并修改 payload 的 Extension，用于下载媒体附件</li>\n<li><strong>Notification Content Extension</strong>（iOS）：自定义通知展开后 UI 的 Extension（长按/3D Touch 触发）</li>\n<li><strong>NotificationCompat.Style</strong>（Android）：BigPictureStyle/MessagingStyle/InboxStyle 等丰富通知样式</li>\n<li><strong>Action Button</strong>：通知上的交互按钮（iOS 最多 4 个，Android 最多 3 个），支持后台执行或打开 app</li>\n<li><strong>Inline Reply</strong>：通知内直接回复文本的能力（UNTextInputNotificationAction / RemoteInput）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ios-notification-service-extension\">iOS Notification Service Extension</h2><p>iOS 通过 Notification Service Extension（NSE）实现富媒体：系统在展示通知之前，给 Extension 最多 30 秒的时间下载并附加媒体资源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant A as APNs&#10;    participant S as System&#10;    participant E as Notification Service Extension&#10;    participant U as User (Lock Screen)&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;S: 收到推送 (mutable-content: 1)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;E: 调用 didReceive(_:withContentHandler:)&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;E: 下载图片/视频,修改 content&#10;    E--&gt;&gt;S: 回调 contentHandler(modifiedContent)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;U: 展示富媒体通知&#10;    Note over S,E: 超时30s未回调则展示原始内容\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as APNs\n    participant S as System\n    participant E as Notification Service Extension\n    participant U as User (Lock Screen)\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;S: 收到推送 (mutable-content: 1)\n    S-&gt;&gt;E: 调用 didReceive(_:withContentHandler:)\n    E-&gt;&gt;E: 下载图片/视频,修改 content\n    E--&gt;&gt;S: 回调 contentHandler(modifiedContent)\n    S-&gt;&gt;U: 展示富媒体通知\n    Note over S,E: 超时30s未回调则展示原始内容</pre><p>触发 NSE 的 payload 必须包含 <code>&quot;mutable-content&quot;: 1</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;aps&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;alert&quot;: { &quot;title&quot;: &quot;新相册&quot;, &quot;body&quot;: &quot;小明分享了3张照片&quot; },&#10;    &quot;mutable-content&quot;: 1&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;image_url&quot;: &quot;https://cdn.example.com/photo_thumb.jpg&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"aps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"新相册\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"小明分享了3张照片\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"mutable-content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"image_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://cdn.example.com/photo_thumb.jpg\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>NSE 中的关键实现逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"override func didReceive(_ request: UNNotificationRequest,&#10;                         withContentHandler contentHandler: @escaping (UNNotificationContent) -&gt; Void) {&#10;    let content = request.content.mutableCopy() as! UNMutableNotificationContent&#10;    guard let imageURL = content.userInfo[&quot;image_url&quot;] as? String,&#10;          let url = URL(string: imageURL) else {&#10;        contentHandler(content)&#10;        return&#10;    }&#10;    downloadMedia(url: url) { localURL in&#10;        if let attachment = try? UNNotificationAttachment(identifier: &quot;image&quot;, url: localURL) {&#10;            content.attachments = [attachment]&#10;        }&#10;        contentHandler(content)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">override</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> didReceive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request: UNNotificationRequest,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                         withContentHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> contentHandler: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@escaping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (UNNotificationContent) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> content </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> request.content.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">mutableCopy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UNMutableNotificationContent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    guard</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> imageURL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> content.userInfo[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> url </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: imageURL) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        contentHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    downloadMedia</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: url) { localURL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attachment </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UNNotificationAttachment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">identifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">url</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: localURL) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            content.attachments </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [attachment]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        contentHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ios-支持的媒体类型与限制\">iOS 支持的媒体类型与限制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>媒体类型</th>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>最大尺寸</th>\n<th>展示方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图片</td>\n<td>JPEG, PNG, GIF</td>\n<td>10 MB</td>\n<td>通知右侧缩略图，3D Touch 展开大图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>音频</td>\n<td>AIFF, WAV, MP3, M4A</td>\n<td>5 MB</td>\n<td>通知内播放控件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视频</td>\n<td>MPEG, MPEG-2, MP4, AVI</td>\n<td>50 MB</td>\n<td>通知内视频播放器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"android-富媒体通知样式\">Android 富媒体通知样式</h2><p>Android 通过 <code>NotificationCompat.Style</code> 子类实现富媒体展示，无需额外 Extension——直接在构建通知时指定样式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常用-style-类型\">常用 Style 类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>展开后展示</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>BigTextStyle</code></td>\n<td>长文本</td>\n<td>完整多行文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BigPictureStyle</code></td>\n<td>大图片</td>\n<td>最大高度 256dp 的图片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>InboxStyle</code></td>\n<td>多行摘要</td>\n<td>最多 5 行独立文本行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>MessagingStyle</code></td>\n<td>对话</td>\n<td>多人对话气泡（Android 11+ 支持 Bubble）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>MediaStyle</code></td>\n<td>音乐控制</td>\n<td>播放控制按钮 + 封面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DecoratedCustomViewStyle</code></td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>开发者定义的 RemoteViews 布局</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>BigPictureStyle</code> 示例（Android 侧需在 FCM 接收后本地构建）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val notification = NotificationCompat.Builder(context, &quot;social&quot;)&#10;    .setContentTitle(&quot;旅行相册更新&quot;)&#10;    .setContentText(&quot;小红分享了新照片&quot;)&#10;    .setSmallIcon(R.drawable.ic_photo)&#10;    .setStyle(NotificationCompat.BigPictureStyle()&#10;        .bigPicture(downloadedBitmap)&#10;        .bigLargeIcon(null as Bitmap?))&#10;    .build()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val notification = NotificationCompat.Builder(context, \"social\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setContentTitle(\"旅行相册更新\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setContentText(\"小红分享了新照片\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setSmallIcon(R.drawable.ic_photo)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setStyle(NotificationCompat.BigPictureStyle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .bigPicture(downloadedBitmap)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .bigLargeIcon(null as Bitmap?))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .build()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Android 对图片/视频的大小限制相比 iOS 更宽松（图片 10MB、视频 50MB），但实际展示尺寸受屏幕通知区域高度限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交互按钮与快捷操作\">交互按钮与快捷操作</h2><h3 id=\"ios-action-buttons\">iOS Action Buttons</h3><p>iOS 通知最多支持 4 个 Action Button（3D Touch/长按展开时可见）。每个 Action 可配置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>authenticationRequired</code>：需要解锁设备才能执行</li>\n<li><code>destructive</code>：红色显示（如&quot;删除&quot;）</li>\n<li><code>foreground</code>：点击后打开 app / <code>background</code>：后台执行</li>\n</ul>\n<p>结合 <code>UNTextInputNotificationAction</code> 可实现通知内直接回复：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"let replyAction = UNTextInputNotificationAction(&#10;    identifier: &quot;REPLY&quot;,&#10;    title: &quot;回复&quot;,&#10;    textInputButtonTitle: &quot;发送&quot;,&#10;    textInputPlaceholder: &quot;输入消息...&quot;&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> replyAction </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UNTextInputNotificationAction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    identifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"REPLY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    title</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"回复\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    textInputButtonTitle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"发送\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    textInputPlaceholder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"输入消息...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"android-action-buttons\">Android Action Buttons</h3><p>Android 通知支持最多 3 个 Action Button。结合 <code>RemoteInput</code> 实现内联回复（inline reply）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val remoteInput = RemoteInput.Builder(&quot;key_reply&quot;)&#10;    .setLabel(&quot;回复消息&quot;)&#10;    .build()&#10;&#10;val replyAction = NotificationCompat.Action.Builder(&#10;    R.drawable.ic_reply, &quot;回复&quot;,&#10;    replyPendingIntent&#10;).addRemoteInput(remoteInput).build()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val remoteInput = RemoteInput.Builder(\"key_reply\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .setLabel(\"回复消息\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val replyAction = NotificationCompat.Action.Builder(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    R.drawable.ic_reply, \"回复\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    replyPendingIntent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>).addRemoteInput(remoteInput).build()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Android 11+ 的 <code>MessagingStyle</code> 通知可以在通知栏直接展示对话历史，并且支持 Bubble（浮窗气泡），让用户不离开当前 app 就能参与对话。</p>\n<h2 id=\"notification-content-extension-ios\">Notification Content Extension（iOS）</h2><p>除了 Service Extension 处理 payload，iOS 还提供 Notification Content Extension 用于自定义通知展开后的 UI——通过一个 View Controller 渲染完全自定义的界面：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Extension 类型</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Service Extension</td>\n<td>通知展示前</td>\n<td>修改 payload、下载附件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Content Extension</td>\n<td>用户长按/3D Touch 展开通知</td>\n<td>自定义 UI、交互控件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Content Extension 适合地图预览、订单进度条、投票界面等复杂交互场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"fcm-富媒体实现路径\">FCM 富媒体实现路径</h2><p>FCM 的 notification message 支持直接在 payload 中指定图片 URL：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;message&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;notification&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;title&quot;: &quot;新品上架&quot;,&#10;      &quot;body&quot;: &quot;限时 8 折&quot;,&#10;      &quot;image&quot;: &quot;https://cdn.example.com/product.jpg&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"notification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"新品上架\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"限时 8 折\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"image\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://cdn.example.com/product.jpg\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>系统会自动下载并展示为 <code>BigPictureStyle</code>（Android）或通知附件（iOS）。但这只适用于简单图片——更复杂的富媒体（视频、自定义布局、多图）需要：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>使用 data message 将媒体 URL 传递给 app</li>\n<li>在 <code>FirebaseMessagingService.onMessageReceived</code> 中下载资源</li>\n<li>本地构建带 Style 的 Notification</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这与 <a href=\"silent-push-background\">静默推送与后台唤醒</a> 中描述的 data message 处理流程一致——富媒体的高级实现本质上是对 data message 的一种应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"富媒体通知的性能考量\">富媒体通知的性能考量</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>考量点</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>图片尺寸</td>\n<td>压缩到 &lt; 500KB</td>\n<td>NSE 只有 30s；用户流量敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CDN 缓存</td>\n<td>必须配置 Cache-Control</td>\n<td>重复通知不应重复下载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级策略</td>\n<td>下载失败时展示纯文本通知</td>\n<td>不能因为图片加载失败就不展示通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隐私</td>\n<td>敏感内容不放在通知预览中</td>\n<td>锁屏时可能被他人看到</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暗色适配</td>\n<td>提供透明底或适应暗色的素材</td>\n<td>Android/iOS 均有暗色模式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>iOS 的 NSE 运行在独立进程中，内存限制约为 24MB。加载大图时需要注意内存峰值，超限会被系统 kill，回退到展示原始 payload。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>富媒体通知将推送从纯文本提升为视觉化的微型交互体验。iOS 通过 Service Extension + Content Extension 双层架构实现，Android 通过 NotificationCompat.Style 体系直接支持。核心权衡是&quot;丰富度&quot;与&quot;可靠性&quot;——媒体下载可能超时或失败，必须设计降级策略确保通知始终能展示。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"富媒体通知与交互","id":"富媒体通知与交互"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS Notification Service Extension","id":"ios-notification-service-extension"},{"level":3,"text":"工作流程","id":"工作流程"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS 支持的媒体类型与限制","id":"ios-支持的媒体类型与限制"},{"level":2,"text":"Android 富媒体通知样式","id":"android-富媒体通知样式"},{"level":3,"text":"常用 Style 类型","id":"常用-style-类型"},{"level":2,"text":"交互按钮与快捷操作","id":"交互按钮与快捷操作"},{"level":3,"text":"iOS Action Buttons","id":"ios-action-buttons"},{"level":3,"text":"Android Action Buttons","id":"android-action-buttons"},{"level":2,"text":"Notification Content Extension（iOS）","id":"notification-content-extension-ios"},{"level":2,"text":"FCM 富媒体实现路径","id":"fcm-富媒体实现路径"},{"level":2,"text":"富媒体通知的性能考量","id":"富媒体通知的性能考量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"通知渠道与分类管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/fundamentals/notification-channels-categories"},"next":{"title":"静默推送与后台唤醒","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-push-notification-engineering/implementation/silent-push-background"}}